{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshFramework"}],"title":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","externalID":"c:PWTypes.h@T@PushwooshRegistrationHandler","fragments":[{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"typealias","roleHeading":"Type Alias","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshErrorHandler"],"title":"Related Documentation"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS\/documentation\/PushwooshFramework\/PushwooshRegistrationHandler","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwooshregistrationhandler"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completion handler called when push notification registration completes."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"typedef","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSString#*$objc(cs)NSError)","text":"void (^)(NSString *, NSError *)"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This closure is called when the device registration process finishes, either successfully or with an error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The handler receives two parameters:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"token","type":"text"}]},{"text":": The push token string if registration succeeded, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if it failed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"error"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": An error object if registration failed, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" if it succeeded","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle registration result with UI updates and backend sync:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["func registerForNotifications() {","    let registrationHandler: PushwooshRegistrationHandler = { token, error in","        if let error = error {","            self.logger.error(\"Push registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","            self.updateNotificationStatus(.failed)","            return","        }","","        guard let token = token else { return }","","        self.logger.info(\"Push token received: \\(token.prefix(20))...\")","        self.updateNotificationStatus(.registered)","","        self.syncPushTokenWithBackend(token)","    }","","    Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications(withCompletion: registrationHandler)","}","","func syncPushTokenWithBackend(_ token: String) {","    let hwid = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","    apiClient.post(\"\/devices\/register\", body: [","        \"push_token\": token,","        \"hwid\": hwid,","        \"platform\": \"ios\"","    ])","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshiOS/documentation/PushwooshFramework/PushwooshRegistrationHandler":{"fragments":[{"text":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshframework\/pushwooshregistrationhandler","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PushwooshRegistrationHandler","kind":"symbol"